# Source Prep time: 5 min
# Source Cook time: 35 min
# Source Servings: 6

::ingredients

(egg, free-range) 8
(potato) 1kg
(white onion) 1
(extra virgin olive oil) enough to fry potatoes and onion
(salt) to taste

::equipment

(frying pan, nonstick)
(frying pan, for onion)
(bowl)
(slotted spoon)
(plate, large)

::instructions

(potato) <peel> <rinse> <dry> <slice, thinly>
    + (salt) <stir, bowl>
(extra virgin olive oil) <heat, nonstick frying pan, enough for all potato slices>
    + (potato) <fry, low, ~20m>
Meanwhile [
    (egg) <beat, bowl>
    (white onion) <peel> <cut, as finely as possible>
        + (extra virgin olive oil) <fry, another pan, slowly, until slightly golden>
        <drain> <add, to eggs>
]
(potato) <remove, slotted spoon, drain as much oil as possible>
    <add, to egg and onion>
{mixture} <rest, at least 5m, stir very gently occasionally>
(potato frying pan) <empty, remove oil>
{mixture} <cook, same pan, medium-high, ~5m>
    <flip, using large plate> <cook, other side, 5m>

::notes
Things like the slicing of the potato, the amount of salt and how curdled is the inner part of the tortilla depend on your own taste. Don't be afraid to experiment!

